---
layout: base.njk
title: Book a consultation
permalink: /contact/
description: "Book a wardrobe consultation with Halie of The Urban Sophisticate Collective. Cincinnati and Northern Kentucky."
---
<div class="wrap page-head"><h1>Start with a conversation.</h1><p class="lede">Tell Halie what you're dressing for and what isn't working. The consultation narrows your goals and shows how she can help.</p></div>
<section class="band" style="padding-top:1.5rem">
  <div class="wrap two-col top">
    {% if site.calendly %}
    <div class="calendly-inline-widget" data-url="{{ site.calendly }}" style="min-width:320px;height:700px"></div>
    <script src="https://assets.calendly.com/assets/external/widget.js" async></script>
    {% else %}
    <form class="form" action="https://formsubmit.co/{{ site.email }}" method="POST">
      <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Consultation request from the website">
      <label>Name <input type="text" name="name" required></label>
      <label>Email <input type="email" name="email" required></label>
      <label>I'm interested in
        <select name="service"><option>A consultation</option><option>Wardrobe and color analysis</option><option>Personalized selections</option><option>Styling for an event</option><option>Styling for my child</option><option>Something else</option></select>
      </label>
      <label>What are you dressing for? <textarea name="message" rows="5"></textarea></label>
      <button class="btn" type="submit">Send</button>
    </form>
    {% endif %}
    <div>
      <h3>Or reach out directly</h3>
      <p>Send a message on <a href="{{ site.instagram }}">Instagram</a>, or DM "wardrobe consult" to learn more about our services.</p>
      <p><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
      <p>{{ site.territory }}, and by appointment.</p>
      <h3 style="margin-top:2rem">What happens next</h3>
      <ol class="next">
        <li><strong>Consultation.</strong> A deep dive into your style goals, and how Halie can help.</li>
        <li><strong>Color analysis and wardrobe audit.</strong> What is working, what can change.</li>
        <li><strong>Shopping.</strong> The plan goes into action: vintage, high street, athletic, and custom.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
